WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.480
Every Check has a Records page, with everything it has ever collected.

2
00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:11.260
Once you have enough Records, filters appear: today, 7 days, 30 days and so on.

3
00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:17.560
You can switch between By title and By user to see the same Records another way.

4
00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:22.300
You can click a title and you see its whole history, one Record after another.

5
00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:28.410
You can press Download all and choose a file type for every Record at once.

6
00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:32.200
Quickler packs them into a zip with each Record in its own folder.

7
00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:37.900
You can also open any Record and add more photos, or drag them to

8
00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:39.040
where they belong, like this.

9
00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:43.760
When you click on a photo, you can turn it like this.

10
00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:48.460
You can change its caption here and type what you like, like this.

11
00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:52.540
Or you can copy it by clicking here, like this.

12
00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:55.500
Or you can archive it if you don't want it on the Record.

13
00:00:55.500 --> 00:01:00.280
An archived photo waits all the way down here at the bottom.

14
00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:03.340
You can bring it back by clicking here.

15
00:01:03.340 --> 00:01:07.780
A document sent during the walk, much like a PDF, is kept with the

16
00:01:07.780 --> 00:01:09.800
Record too, down here.

17
00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:14.760
Press Changes and time taken to see how long the walk and edits took.

18
00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:19.300
Every change sits under its question with who made it and when.

19
00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:24.980
To delete a Record, press Delete, then confirm in the box that it opens.

20
00:01:25.780 --> 00:01:30.300
You get about 10 seconds to press Undo and the Record comes straight back.

21
00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:35.100
Even after that, a Record is kept for 30 days after being deleted,

22
00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:36.680
so if you need it, just ask us.
